{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your soul\u2019s been nicked by El Diablo. You shall commence A supernatural open-world pixel western RPG experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Think Spaghetti Western, Day Of The Dead, light rpg</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Free Demo Available Now!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo is now live! Play today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0!8 Steam Curators Recommend Day of Pixel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless youtuber feedback, many many pastor tacos eaten in this process sorry Chorizo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play How You Like</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>El Diablo:</strong> complete quests and missions like, fighting a giant moustache named El Bigote</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Battles:</strong>\u00a0embark across Mexico, the underworld, Texas, and New Mexico oh more to come.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt Bounties:\u00a0</strong>Track down random outlaws from Town posters, and earn pesos as you make a name for yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Roaming Gangs:</strong> Dynamic gangs fight, taunt, and push against each other's control whether you help or not.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Frontier Life:</strong> Farm\u00a0 over twelve crops, cook more than 20 foods and empanadas! Or stop by saloons and shops for a quick bite before you head out on the trail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ownership &amp; Trade:</strong> Buy cantinas, ranches, and shops. Regions have there own economies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Underworld Portals:</strong> D\u00eda de los Muertos inspired underworld and tone, you might find slain enemies who remember you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Companions:</strong> Alongside Salem (my real life cat) you may find companions spread out, they will help you survive and take out El Diablo!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minigames:</strong> Relax and play poker, gaze at the stars, or sit on any bench or sit and let the world just pass.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Call, Partner</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help El Diablo, or kill him and save the world. While experiencing the vast worlds hand built by me and my cat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built by One Mad Cowboy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6+ years of solo development. Hand-drawn maps and pixel art. With help of my artist to clean my bad animal drawings\u00a0@yankonnin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games For Gamers Always</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2003150?t=1771294114","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003150/68ea395904041bf7734f7301f60f117b92a021c1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771294114","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003150/d63c3323082e56cfe769c5f643e108362442b1ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771294114","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003150/d63c3323082e56cfe769c5f643e108362442b1ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771294114","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2092370,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your soul\u2019s been nicked by El Diablo. You shall commence A supernatural open-world pixel western RPG experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Think Spaghetti Western, Day Of The Dead, light rpg</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Free Demo Available Now!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph